{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","role":"article","title":"Manual Integration"},"abstract":[{"text":"Integrate the Adyen Issuing SDK by embedding XCFrameworks directly into your Xcode project.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.adyen.IssuingSDKDocs\/documentation\/Issuing-SDK\/ManualIntegration","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you cannot use Swift Package Manager, you can integrate the SDK by manually embedding the pre-built XCFrameworks into your project. This guide covers which frameworks to include, how to configure your project, and what to import in your code.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Download-the-SDK","level":2,"text":"Download the SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Obtain the SDK distribution package from Adyen. The package contains the following structure:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"text","type":"codeListing","code":["Build-IssuingSDK\/","├── XCFrameworks\/","│   ├── NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","│   ├── IssuingCore.xcframework","│   └── IssuingCommon.xcframework","└── Documentation\/"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You also need the "},{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" SDK, available from ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/Adyen\/adyen-apple-pay-provisioning-ios","type":"reference"},{"text":". Download the ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayExtensionProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" if you use a Wallet Extension)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Required-Frameworks","level":2,"text":"Required Frameworks","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"Network-Token-Provisioning","text":"Network Token Provisioning","type":"heading","level":3},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All of the following frameworks are "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"required"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" for Apple Wallet provisioning:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"table","header":"row","rows":[[[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Framework","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Purpose","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Import in Code?","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Provisioning logic and public API","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Shared types ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TokenProviding"},{"type":"text","text":", etc.)"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Yes","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Internal secure communication","type":"text"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}]}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Apple Pay provisioning interface","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"}],"type":"paragraph"}]]]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" must be embedded in your app for the SDK to function, but you should "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"not"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" import them in your code. They are used internally by ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning"},{"type":"text","text":" and should not be accessed directly."}]}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Embed the Frameworks","type":"heading","anchor":"Embed-the-Frameworks","level":2},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Drag all four ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".xcframework"},{"text":" bundles into your Xcode project navigator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Select your app target, go to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"General > Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure all frameworks are listed and set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed & Sign"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":":","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCore.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" — Embed & Sign"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"}]}]},{"text":"Import Statements","type":"heading","anchor":"Import-Statements","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"When embedding manually, import the individual modules — not the SPM wrapper name:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import NetworkTokenProvisioning","import IssuingCommon"]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"With SPM, you use "},{"code":"import AdyenNetworkTokenProvisioning","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" instead (which re-exports both modules automatically). When embedding manually, you must import each module separately."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","name":"Note"},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Keychain-Access-Group","text":"Keychain Access Group","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app uses extensions (e.g., a Wallet Extension for background provisioning), configure a shared keychain access group:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Enable ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Keychain Sharing"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" in your app target’s ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Signing & Capabilities"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Add the same access group to both the app and the extension.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Pass the access group identifier when configuring the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let parameters = ConfigurationParameters(","    appCertificate: certificate,","    paymentInstrumentIds: [paymentInstrumentId],","    keychainAccessGroup: \"[TeamId].com.yourcompany.shared\",","    environment: .live",")"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Wallet-Extension-Support","text":"Wallet Extension Support","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If your app includes a Wallet Extension for provisioning cards in the background, the extension target requires the following frameworks with "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":":"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NetworkTokenProvisioning.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayExtensionProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" (instead of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning"},{"type":"text","text":")"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In the extension, use the same imports:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import NetworkTokenProvisioning","import IssuingCommon"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Verify-the-Integration","text":"Verify the Integration","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After embedding:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"orderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build the project. All three frameworks should compile and link without errors."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Run on the iOS Simulator to verify basic initialization."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Test provisioning on a physical device (simulators do not support Apple Wallet)."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Troubleshooting","level":2,"text":"Troubleshooting","type":"heading"},{"anchor":"No-such-module-NetworkTokenProvisioning","level":3,"text":"“No such module ‘NetworkTokenProvisioning’”","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Ensure the XCFramework is added to your target’s "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Frameworks, Libraries, and Embedded Content"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" section and is set to "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Embed & Sign"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"No-such-module-IssuingCommon","level":3,"text":"“No such module ‘IssuingCommon’”","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Same as above — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCommon.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" must also be embedded. This framework contains shared types like "},{"code":"TokenProviding","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: IssuingCore”","anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-IssuingCore"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"IssuingCore.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. Add it to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" even though you don’t import it in code. The other frameworks depend on it at runtime."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Runtime crash: “Library not loaded: AdyenApplePayProvisioning”","anchor":"Runtime-crash-Library-not-loaded-AdyenApplePayProvisioning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AdyenApplePayProvisioning.xcframework"},{"type":"text","text":" is not embedded. It is a required dependency for Network Token Provisioning. Add it to "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Embed & Sign","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Duplicate symbols","anchor":"Duplicate-symbols"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you see duplicate symbol errors, ensure you are not linking both the SPM package and the manual XCFrameworks in the same target. Use one integration method, not both."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarch